      "target": "Data/Festivals/fall27",
      "key": "Alex_spouse_y2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey, you made it past the creepy hands.$1#$e#I think I hear someone calling for help nearby.$0",
      "translation": "Hele, strašidelné ruce máš za sebou.$1#$e#Mám dojem, že někde poblíž někdo volá o pomoc.$0",
