      "key": "Sebastian_spouse_y2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey, could you... give me a hand? Hehehe...$h#$e#These gravestones would look nice on the farm, don't you think?$0",
      "translation": "Ahoj, můžeš mi... podat pomocnou ruku? Hehehe...$h#$e#Tyhle náhrobky by na farmě vypadaly dobře, nemyslíš?$0",
