      "key": "Sam_spouse_y2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "My little brother and I made it pretty far in here but we got stuck.#$e#You go on ahead... find that treasure for us!",
      "translation": "S bratříčkem jsme se dostali docela daleko, ale pak jsme uvázli.#$e#Jdi napřed... najdi pro nás ten poklad!",
      "sourceSHA256": "f888c8fd583e51de303d828a84fe872e5946f9422808dd00225a07337871b123",
